cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata.
type: software
title: "Adaptive Portfolio Manager"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-08-28"
license: MIT
authors:
  - family-names: Tabasi
    given-names: Hossein
keywords:
  - portfolio optimization
  - mean-variance
  - hierarchical risk parity
  - LSTM
  - walk-forward backtest
abstract: >
  A research tool that allocates and periodically rebalances a multi-asset
  portfolio using walk-forward LSTM (or Ridge) forecasts of return and
  volatility, with mean-variance and hierarchical risk parity constructors,
  a moving-average regime filter, and transaction-cost-aware backtests.
  Results are historical simulations on public Yahoo Finance prices or a
  labeled TOY panel. They are not live trading profits.
